g through internships. The field offers exciting career paths and opportunities.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Topics Included<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Food and Beverage Control<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hotel Grading System<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Room Division Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Retail Operation and Entrepreneurship Development<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Resort Designing Development and Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bar and Beverage Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Event and Disaster Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Food Production and Patisserie<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hotel Law<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hotel Security and Executive Protection<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Accommodation Operation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analysing Tourism and Hospitality Business<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Marketing Communications for Tourism and Hospitality<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sales and Marketing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Front Office Operation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Property Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Housekeeping Service &amp; Maintenance&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hospitality Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Facility planning<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Career Paths<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Hotel Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Front Desk Executive<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hospitality Coordinator<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Restaurant Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Event Coordinator<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Travel Consultant<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Concierge Services Manager<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Course Duration<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Min 1 year<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Average Course Fee<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>\u20b91.50 &#8211; 3 lakh<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Choose the Right Course After 12th Arts?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you complete high school, you need to make some carefully thought-out decisions to choose the right career path. However, selecting the right course is not a cakewalk, as you need to consider various factors, including your interests, aspirations, industry trends, future prospects, and more. So, here are a few points to help you get more clarity and choose the right course for yourself:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Research Career Prospects<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>As you select the right course, make sure to be aware of all possible career paths and opportunities that the course offers. Educate yourself about the possible prospects, job roles, growth opportunities, and earning potential. You can enrol in our graphic design or digital marketing course and talk to industry experts to understand various domains and possible opportunities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Job Flexibility and Skill Development<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This is another important aspect to consider to make a successful career. Sticking to one type of job can be monotonous and stop your growth and learning. Hence, opt for the course with a broad career scope so you can have a smooth career transition if you acquire new interests in the future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Your Interests and Strengths&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This is an obvious and first component to consider when selecting a course after school. Assess your interests, academic strengths, and skills, and then explore different fields to suit the one that aligns with your preferences.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Industry Trends<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>As you make progress and advance in your career, you must inculcate various skills and focus on continuous learning. Due to emerging industry trends, you must hone transferable skills, so choose the field which is expected to witness significant growth in job roles.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp